1
00:00:00,777 --> 00:00:02,377
(Amy:)So what happened?
How'd it go?

2
00:00:02,546 --> 00:00:05,116
(Bernadette:)It's fine. I thanked them again and
let them know we're not available.

3
00:00:05,282 --> 00:00:09,232
(Amy:)So I can drink this without having
to give up the goodies?

4
00:00:09,386 --> 00:00:11,666
Yes, ifs all cool.

5
00:00:11,822 --> 00:00:15,732
Although, it you wanted to talk to
one of them, no one would blame you.

6
00:00:15,893 --> 00:00:17,373
(Amy:)And why would no one blame me?

7
00:00:19,329 --> 00:00:21,739
(Bernadette:)I don't know what I'm saying.

8
00:00:21,899 --> 00:00:25,969
(Amy:)Well, it sounds like you're saying
that I could do better than Sheldon.

9
00:00:26,136 --> 00:00:28,246
Boy, these drinks are strong!

10
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:33,983
Oh, Mama, I'm gonna be
hugging the toilet tonight!

11
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:38,579
(Amy:)No, tell me. I want to know
what you meant by that.

12
00:00:40,918 --> 00:00:43,088
(Bernadette:)I just meant that you're not married,

13
00:00:43,253 --> 00:00:47,263
and your boyfriends
kind of... Sheldon.

14
00:00:48,425 --> 00:00:52,605
(Amy:)And your husband is extremely Howard.
What's your point?

15
00:00:53,931 --> 00:00:57,401
(Bernadette:)Sorry, I have no point.
That was a stupid thing to say.

